  "isInteractive": false,
  "cta": false
 },
 {
  "speaker": "小蓝",
  "voice": "zh_female_shuangkuaisisi_uranus_bigtts",
  "text": "我是小蓝，周末特别版又跟大家见面啦。",
  "dur": 3.0084583333333335,
  "bg": "opening_bg.jpg",
  "video": "",
  "videoDur": 0,
  "isBreaking": false,
  "isInteractive": false,
  "cta": false
 },
 {
  "speaker": "阿信",
  "voice": "zh_male_m191_uranus_bigtts",
  "text": "先给大家插播一条突发消息。喜马拉雅冰川崩塌酿成中尼边境致命洪水。8月26日喜马拉雅山脉一处冰川崩塌引发泥石流，冲毁中尼边境吉隆口岸与尼泊尔村庄，已致160余人死亡、近1500人失踪，含大批外国游客，路透社、BBC、美联社均已确认，救援仍在持续。",
  "dur": 24.265125,
  "bg": "breaking.jpg",
  "video": "breaking_footage.mp4",
  "videoDur": 20.434,
  "isBreaking": true,
  "isInteractive": false,
  "cta": false
 },
 {
  "speaker": "小蓝",
  "voice": "zh_female_shuangkuaisisi_uranus_bigtts",
  "text": "看到这消息我心里一沉，愿前方的人都能平安。",
  "dur": 3.8942916666666667,
  "bg": "breaking.jpg",
  "video": "breaking_footage.mp4",
  "videoDur": 20.434,
  "isBreaking": true,
  "isInteractive": false,
  "cta": false
 },
 {
  "speaker": "阿信",
  "voice": "zh_male_m191_uranus_bigtts",
  "text": "接着聊科技。黄仁勋官宣英伟达与SpaceX共押太空AI算力新赛道。英伟达披露持有SpaceX约1.23亿股、成第六大股东，马斯克承诺未来AI算力独家采用英伟达Vera Rubin架构，双方要把数据中心搬上轨道卫星。",
  "dur": 18.97475,
  "bg": "news_01.jpg",
  "video": "",
  "videoDur": 0,
  "isBreaking": false,
  "isInteractive": false,
  "cta": false
 },
 {
  "speaker": "小蓝",
  "voice": "zh_female_shuangkuaisisi_uranus_bigtts",
  "text": "黄仁勋这是要把数据中心直接搬出地球啊，马斯克也真敢接，我就坐等它真上天那天。",
  "dur": 6.6734583333333335,
  "bg": "news_01.jpg",
  "video": "",
  "videoDur": 0,
  "isBreaking": false,
  "isInteractive": false,
  "cta": false
 },
 {
  "speaker": "阿信",
  "voice": "zh_male_m191_uranus_bigtts",
  "text": "资本和算力绑得越来越紧，轨道数据中心要是成了，整个AI基建的玩法都得变。",
  "dur": 6.219125,
  "bg": "news_01.jpg",
  "video": "",
  "videoDur": 0,
  "isBreaking": false,
  "isInteractive": false,
  "cta": false
 },
 {
  "speaker": "阿信",
  "voice": "zh_male_m191_uranus_bigtts",
  "text": "接着聊民生。江苏常州一上市公司批量劝退应届生，107人被解约。星宇股份2026届校招440人，入职仅一月便以\"离职补偿半月薪\"或\"调岗流水线打螺丝\"二选一约谈，常州人社局通报、人资总监停职，公司8月27日致歉。",
  "dur": 21.105041666666665,
  "bg": "news_02.jpg",
  "video": "",
  "videoDur": 0,
  "isBreaking": false,
  "isInteractive": false,
  "cta": false
 },
 {
  "speaker": "小蓝",
  "voice": "zh_female_shuangkuaisisi_uranus_bigtts",
  "text": "刚毕业一个月就被‘劝退’，这操作也太寒心了，真希望监管能盯住别成惯例。",
  "dur": 5.888541666666667,
  "bg": "news_02.jpg",
  "video": "",
  "videoDur": 0,
  "isBreaking": false,
  "isInteractive": false,
  "cta": false
 },
 {
  "speaker": "阿信",
  "voice": "zh_male_m191_uranus_bigtts",
  "text": "校招承诺和现实落差这么大，暴露的还是用工合规的缺口，得有人管。",
  "dur": 6.706083333333333,
  "bg": "news_02.jpg",
  "video": "",
  "videoDur": 0,
  "isBreaking": false,
  "isInteractive": false,
  "cta": false
 },
 {
  "speaker": "阿信",
  "voice": "zh_male_m191_uranus_bigtts",
  "text": "接着聊娱乐。孙宇晨发《我的女友景甜》万字长文，引爆全网。波场创始人孙宇晨8月27日发布标注\"纯属虚构\"的长文，同日律师确认已起诉景甜及父母追讨三千余万彩礼，景甜工作室怒斥\"碰瓷\"，网友一边倒批评。",
  "dur": 20.261791666666667,
  "bg": "news_03.jpg",
  "video": "",
  "videoDur": 0,
  "isBreaking": false,
  "isInteractive": false,
  "cta": false
 },
 {
  "speaker": "小蓝",
  "voice": "zh_female_shuangkuaisisi_uranus_bigtts",
  "text": "这瓜我嗑得有点离谱，长文加起诉，剧本都比电视剧敢写，咱们吃瓜别上头。",
  "dur": 6.094791666666667,
  "bg": "news_03.jpg",
  "video": "",
  "videoDur": 0,
  "isBreaking": false,
  "isInteractive": false,
  "cta": false
 },
 {
  "speaker": "阿信",
  "voice": "zh_male_m191_uranus_bigtts",
  "text": "热度是真高，不过真假让子弹飞一会儿，别被流量节奏带跑了。",
  "dur": 4.296375,
  "bg": "news_03.jpg",
  "video": "",
  "videoDur": 0,
  "isBreaking": false,
  "isInteractive": false,
  "cta": false
 },
 {
  "speaker": "阿信",
  "voice": "zh_male_m191_uranus_bigtts",
  "text": "接着聊时事。台风\"紫檀\"等三台风接连袭东南沿海，广西等地洪涝。8月下旬第18号\"沙德尔\"、19号\"紫檀\"、20号\"简拉维\"三台风接连影响华南华东，广西崇左等地发生洪涝，国家启动四级救灾应急响应，多省渔船回港避风。",
  "dur": 21.587625,
  "bg": "news_04.jpg",
  "video": "",
  "videoDur": 0,
  "isBreaking": false,
  "isInteractive": false,
  "cta": false
 },
 {
  "speaker": "小蓝",
  "voice": "zh_female_shuangkuaisisi_uranus_bigtts",
  "text": "天呐太揪心了，接连三个台风往咱这边来，盼沿海的同胞都平平安安的。",
  "dur": 6.4855,
  "bg": "news_04.jpg",
  "video": "",
  "videoDur": 0,
  "isBreaking": false,
  "isInteractive": false,
  "cta": false
 },
 {
  "speaker": "阿信",
  "voice": "zh_male_m191_uranus_bigtts",
  "text": "强度叠加、影响面广，渔船回港、应急响应都得跟上，后续复盘也关键。",
  "dur": 6.476666666666667,
  "bg": "news_04.jpg",
  "video": "",
  "videoDur": 0,
  "isBreaking": false,
  "isInteractive": false,
  "cta": false
 },
 {
  "speaker": "阿信",
  "voice": "zh_male_m191_uranus_bigtts",
  "text": "接着聊科技。OpenAI首款自研推理芯片Jalapeño发布。OpenAI联手博通打造的首代推理芯片Jalapeño发布，功耗仅700瓦，每瓦AI产出较英伟达现役系统提升1.5至1.9倍，被视为推理市场的\"鲶鱼\"。",
  "dur": 17.085625,
  "bg": "news_05.jpg",
  "video": "",
  "videoDur": 0,
  "isBreaking": false,
  "isInteractive": false,
  "cta": false
 },
 {
  "speaker": "小蓝",
  "voice": "zh_female_shuangkuaisisi_uranus_bigtts",
  "text": "OpenAI自己下场造芯了，英伟达这下压力山大，咱们就等看价格战香不香。",
  "dur": 5.859708333333334,
  "bg": "news_05.jpg",
  "video": "",
  "videoDur": 0,
  "isBreaking": false,
  "isInteractive": false,
  "cta": false
 },
 {
  "speaker": "阿信",
  "voice": "zh_male_m191_uranus_bigtts",
  "text": "每瓦产出提快一倍，推理成本要是真降下来，中小团队最受益。",
  "dur": 5.65575,
  "bg": "news_05.jpg",
  "video": "",
  "videoDur": 0,
  "isBreaking": false,
  "isInteractive": false,
  "cta": false
 },
 {
  "speaker": "阿信",
  "voice": "zh_male_m191_uranus_bigtts",
  "text": "接着聊时事。中消协明确AI客服不得用\"自动生成\"免责。中消协提醒经营者不得以\"人工智能自动生成\"\"系统自动回复\"逃避责任，部分AI客服价格说明与优惠规则解释不准，须建立责任承接机制并提供便捷人工客服。",
  "dur": 20.051416666666668,
  "bg": "news_06.jpg",
  "video": "",
  "videoDur": 0,
  "isBreaking": false,
  "isInteractive": false,
  "cta": false
 },
 {
  "speaker": "小蓝",
  "voice": "zh_female_shuangkuaisisi_uranus_bigtts",
  "text": "最烦AI客服绕来绕去还甩锅‘自动生成’，这回消协发话，就该给人工留个口子。",
  "dur": 7.428333333333334,
  "bg": "news_06.jpg",
  "video": "",
  "videoDur": 0,
  "isBreaking": false,
  "isInteractive": false,
  "cta": false
 },
 {
  "speaker": "阿信",
  "voice": "zh_male_m191_uranus_bigtts",
  "text": "拿‘系统自动回复’当挡箭牌行不通了，责任承接机制得落地，这点消协说到点上了。",
  "dur": 6.672958333333334,
  "bg": "news_06.jpg",
  "video": "",
  "videoDur": 0,
  "isBreaking": false,
  "isInteractive": false,
  "cta": false
 },
 {
  "speaker": "阿信",
  "voice": "zh_male_m191_uranus_bigtts",
  "text": "接着聊科技。苹果发布M6芯片，首发2nm制程。苹果推出M6（新2nm，AI性能较M5提升近30%）与M5 Ultra（最高512GB统一内存），新Mac mini起售6999元，多款较前代涨价。",
  "dur": 19.395041666666668,
  "bg": "news_07.jpg",
  "video": "",
  "videoDur": 0,
  "isBreaking": false,
  "isInteractive": false,
  "cta": false
 },
 {
  "speaker": "小蓝",
  "voice": "zh_female_shuangkuaisisi_uranus_bigtts",
  "text": "苹果这2nm来得是猛，就是涨价也猛，我的钱包又要遭罪了。",
  "dur": 4.7085,
  "bg": "news_07.jpg",
  "video": "",
  "videoDur": 0,
  "isBreaking": false,
  "isInteractive": false,
  "cta": false
 },
 {
  "speaker": "阿信",
  "voice": "zh_male_m191_uranus_bigtts",
  "text": "性能涨近三成、内存顶到512G，冲着本地大模型去的，专业用户会买账。",
  "dur": 7.938833333333333,
  "bg": "news_07.jpg",
  "video": "",
  "videoDur": 0,
  "isBreaking": false,
  "isInteractive": false,
  "cta": false
 },
 {
  "speaker": "阿信",
  "voice": "zh_male_m191_uranus_bigtts",
  "text": "接着聊科技。小鹏机器人业务完成首轮超9亿美元融资。8月24日小鹏集团宣布旗下人形机器人业务鹏行智能完成首轮超9亿美元融资，投后估值超63亿美元（约430亿元），刷新中国具身智能行业单轮私募股权融资纪录，由IDG资本领投、腾讯与阿里巴巴战略参投，IRON人形机器人计划2026年底量产。",
  "dur": 27.691291666666668,
  "bg": "news_08.jpg",
  "video": "",
  "videoDur": 0,
  "isBreaking": false,
  "isInteractive": false,
  "cta": false
 },
 {
  "speaker": "小蓝",
  "voice": "zh_female_shuangkuaisisi_uranus_bigtts",
  "text": "小鹏这是真要造‘打工人’机器人了，9亿美元砸下去，2026底量产我可盯着呢。",
  "dur": 6.22,
  "bg": "news_08.jpg",
  "video": "",
  "videoDur": 0,
  "isBreaking": false,
  "isInteractive": false,
  "cta": false
 },
 {
  "speaker": "阿信",
  "voice": "zh_male_m191_uranus_bigtts",
  "text": "单轮私募破纪录，资本用脚投票具身智能，但量产交付才是真考验。",
  "dur": 6.882916666666667,
  "bg": "news_08.jpg",
  "video": "",
  "videoDur": 0,
  "isBreaking": false,
  "isInteractive": false,
  "cta": false
 },
 {
  "speaker": "阿信",
  "voice": "zh_male_m191_uranus_bigtts",
  "text": "接着聊时事。欧洲极端热浪致逾两万五千人超额死亡。西欧经历有记录以来最热6至7月，8月高温持续，约8000万人被40℃以上高温笼罩，法国等国通报热浪期间超额死亡逾2.5万例，农业与内河航运受重创。",
  "dur": 20.18325,
  "bg": "news_09.jpg",
  "video": "",
  "videoDur": 0,
  "isBreaking": false,
  "isInteractive": false,
  "cta": false
 },
 {
  "speaker": "小蓝",
  "voice": "zh_female_shuangkuaisisi_uranus_bigtts",
  "text": "欧洲这波热浪太吓人了，两万多人超额死亡，愿那边的人都挺过去。",
  "dur": 6.115083333333334,
  "bg": "news_09.jpg",
  "video": "",
  "videoDur": 0,
  "isBreaking": false,
  "isInteractive": false,
  "cta": false
 },
 {
  "speaker": "阿信",
  "voice": "zh_male_m191_uranus_bigtts",
  "text": "极端高温从偶发变常态，农业和内河航运先扛不住，城市韧性得重算。",
  "dur": 7.025791666666667,
  "bg": "news_09.jpg",
  "video": "",
  "videoDur": 0,
  "isBreaking": false,
  "isInteractive": false,
  "cta": false
 },
 {
  "speaker": "阿信",
  "voice": "zh_male_m191_uranus_bigtts",
  "text": "接着聊民生。上海楼市\"沪八条\"落地，外环外二套首付降至15%。上海8月21日起实施\"沪八条\"，外环外二套商贷首付由20%降至15%，推出\"以旧换新\"购房补贴最高8万元，并扩大公积金付首付范围，为\"金九银十\"蓄势。",
  "dur": 24.14475,
  "bg": "news_10.jpg",
  "video": "",
  "videoDur": 0,
  "isBreaking": false,
  "isInteractive": false,
  "cta": false
 },
 {
  "speaker": "小蓝",
  "voice": "zh_female_shuangkuaisisi_uranus_bigtts",
  "text": "上海这‘沪八条’挺实在，首付降了、补贴有了，刚需家庭可以好好看看。",
  "dur": 5.88925,
  "bg": "news_10.jpg",
  "video": "",
  "videoDur": 0,
  "isBreaking": false,
  "isInteractive": false,
  "cta": false
 },
 {
  "speaker": "阿信",
  "voice": "zh_male_m191_uranus_bigtts",
  "text": "外环外二套首付降到15%，‘金九银十’前松口子，信号意义大于金额。",
  "dur": 6.62875,
  "bg": "news_10.jpg",
  "video": "",
  "videoDur": 0,
  "isBreaking": false,
  "isInteractive": false,
  "cta": false
 },
 {
  "speaker": "阿信",
  "voice": "zh_male_m191_uranus_bigtts",
  "text": "接着聊民生。育儿补贴发放提速，每孩每年3600元。国家育儿补贴基础标准每孩每年3600元至满3周岁，2022至2024年出生婴幼儿首次申领截止延长至2026年底；多地通过\"一卡通\"按季直拨，城口、红谷滩等区县已惠及上万人次。",
  "dur": 23.054916666666667,
  "bg": "news_11.jpg",
  "video": "",
  "videoDur": 0,
  "isBreaking": false,
  "isInteractive": false,
  "cta": false
 },
 {
  "speaker": "小蓝",
  "voice": "zh_female_shuangkuaisisi_uranus_bigtts",
  "text": "一年3600不算多，但‘按季直拨’这个动作好，就怕卡在最后一公里。",
  "dur": 5.727458333333334,
  "bg": "news_11.jpg",
  "video": "",
  "videoDur": 0,
  "isBreaking": false,
  "isInteractive": false,
  "cta": false
 },
 {
  "speaker": "阿信",
  "voice": "zh_male_m191_uranus_bigtts",
  "text": "基础标准加‘一卡通’直拨，方向对，关键看地方执行有没有水分。",
  "dur": 5.683083333333333,
  "bg": "news_11.jpg",
  "video": "",
  "videoDur": 0,
  "isBreaking": false,
  "isInteractive": false,
  "cta": false
 },
 {
  "speaker": "阿信",
  "voice": "zh_male_m191_uranus_bigtts",
  "text": "接着聊民生。9月1日起一批民生新规实施。9月1日起国家基本药物目录2026版扩至794种、职工医保个人账户药店支付白名单落地、新版药物临床试验规范施行，与民众就医用药息息相关。",
  "dur": 18.77075,
  "bg": "news_12.jpg",
  "video": "",
  "videoDur": 0,
  "isBreaking": false,
  "isInteractive": false,
  "cta": false
 },
 {
  "speaker": "小蓝",
  "voice": "zh_female_shuangkuaisisi_uranus_bigtts",
  "text": "9月这批新规跟咱看病买药直接相关，记一下，别到时候白跑一趟。",
  "dur": 4.871958333333334,
  "bg": "news_12.jpg",
  "video": "",
  "videoDur": 0,
  "isBreaking": false,
  "isInteractive": false,
  "cta": false
 },
 {
  "speaker": "阿信",
  "voice": "zh_male_m191_uranus_bigtts",
  "text": "基药目录扩到794种、个账药店支付落地，都是贴近日常的实招。",
  "dur": 6.203,
  "bg": "news_12.jpg",
  "video": "",
  "videoDur": 0,
  "isBreaking": false,
  "isInteractive": false,
  "cta": false
 },
 {
  "speaker": "阿信",
  "voice": "zh_male_m191_uranus_bigtts",
  "text": "接着聊娱乐。章子怡3亿套现引质疑，230万投资翻132倍。上美股份公告以3.05亿收购章子怡名下股权，其230万本金八年回报超132倍，被质疑\"明星光环加资本运作\"，团队尚未正面回应。",
  "dur": 21.234833333333334,
  "bg": "news_13.jpg",
  "video": "",
  "videoDur": 0,
  "isBreaking": false,
  "isInteractive": false,
  "cta": false
 },
 {
  "speaker": "小蓝",
  "voice": "zh_female_shuangkuaisisi_uranus_bigtts",
